<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 21/22.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 21/22.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, May 22 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   22.05.97	  21.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6328	    6.5942</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3664	    2.3709</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.6208	    4.6270</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5114	    3.5698</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5322	    0.5298</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7846	    0.7868</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2958	    0.2965</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0703	    7.0753</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6952	    0.6953</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2719	    1.2728</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
